<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: armor spike -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.label>穿甲尖刺</UMW_ArmorSpike.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is reinforced into a heavy armor-piercing spike that punches through plate and carapace. -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.description>尖端經過加固，成為沉重的穿甲尖刺，足以擊穿板甲與甲殼。</UMW_ArmorSpike.description>

  <!-- EN: lancing -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>穿刺</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: armorbane -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>破甲</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: punching -->
  <UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>貫穿</UMW_ArmorSpike.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: barbed -->
  <UMW_Barbed.label>倒刺</UMW_Barbed.label>

  <!-- EN: Barbs behind the point catch in the wound and tear it wider as the weapon is drawn back out. -->
  <UMW_Barbed.description>尖端後方的倒刺會鉤進傷口，在武器拔出時把傷口撕得更大。</UMW_Barbed.description>

  <!-- EN: barbed -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.0>倒刺</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: hooked -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.1>帶鉤</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: cruel -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>殘忍</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.label>鐘鑄錘頭</UMW_BellCast.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is cast solid like a bell. A clean strike rings a resonance through armor and bone, briefly stunning the target. -->
  <UMW_BellCast.description>錘頭如鐘一般整體鑄成。乾淨利落的一擊會令共振穿透護甲與骨骼，短暫擊昏目標。</UMW_BellCast.description>

  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>鐘鑄</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: ringing -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>鳴響</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>共鳴</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.label>染血</UMW_BloodStained.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is caked in layers of dark, dried blood. The sight of it can send the people it wounds fleeing in panic, though carrying so grisly a thing weighs on all but the hardened. Traders will pay less for it. -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.description>該武器上結著一層又一層深色的乾涸血塊。被它所傷的人一見到它就可能驚慌逃竄；但攜帶如此駭人之物，除了鐵石心腸者，誰都會感到心頭沉重。商人會壓價收購。</UMW_BloodStained.description>

  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>染血</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bloody -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>血腥</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: gory -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>浴血</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: sanguine -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>殷紅</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.label>碳化</UMW_Carbonized.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon has been through fire. Its charred surface is hardened by the heat, and what is already burnt does not easily burn again. The hardened surface hits harder than it should, but the scorched body is brittle and weathers badly. -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.description>該武器經歷過烈火。焦黑的表面被高溫硬化，而燒過的東西也不易再度燃燒。硬化的表面打擊力超乎尋常，但燒焦的基體變得脆弱，也經不起風吹日曬。</UMW_Carbonized.description>

  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>碳化</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: fire-blackened -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>火燎</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: charred -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>焦黑</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: soot-stained -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>煙燻</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: counterweighted -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.label>配重</UMW_Counterweighted.label>

  <!-- EN: A counterweight tames the heft, making the weapon quicker to recover between swings at a slight cost to power. -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.description>配重塊馴服了武器的沉重感，使其在揮擊之間恢復得更快，但威力略有損失。</UMW_Counterweighted.description>

  <!-- EN: balanced -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>平衡</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: swift -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>迅捷</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>


  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.label>笨拙</UMW_Cumbersome.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is bulky and overbuilt, slowing its swing. -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.description>該武器粗大笨重、用料過度，揮擊速度較慢。</UMW_Cumbersome.description>

  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>笨拙</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bulky -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>笨重</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ungainly -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>臃腫</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.label>無回彈錘頭</UMW_DeadBlow.label>

  <!-- EN: The hollow head is filled with loose shot that slams forward on impact, dumping the blow's full momentum into the target without a trace of rebound. Struck targets reel and stumble, even when the blow doesn't drop them. -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.description>中空的錘頭內填滿鬆散的彈丸，撞擊時彈丸向前湧去，將這一擊的全部動量灌入目標，沒有絲毫回彈。被擊中的目標會搖晃踉蹌，即使這一擊沒有將其擊倒。</UMW_DeadBlow.description>

  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>無回彈</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: shot-filled -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>灌珠</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: battering -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>衝撞</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: enameled -->
  <UMW_Enameled.label>琺瑯</UMW_Enameled.label>

  <!-- EN: A vitreous enamel has been fired and fused over the body of this weapon, glazing it in a deep, glossy violet. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_Enameled.description>該武器通體燒結了一層玻璃質琺瑯釉，呈現出深邃光亮的紫羅蘭色。商人會為其支付更多錢。</UMW_Enameled.description>

  <!-- EN: enameled -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.0>琺瑯</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: glazed -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.1>釉彩</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: violet-sheened -->
  <UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>泛紫</UMW_Enameled.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: envenomed -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.label>淬毒</UMW_Envenomed.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is coated in a slow neurotoxic venom which causes toxic buildup in those it wounds. -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.description>尖端塗有一種緩效的神經毒液，會在被它所傷者體內造成毒性累積。</UMW_Envenomed.description>

  <!-- EN: envenomed -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.0>淬毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: venomous -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.1>蛇毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: poisoned -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.2>有毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: toxic -->
  <UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.3>劇毒</UMW_Envenomed.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.label>稜脊錘頭</UMW_Flanged.label>

  <!-- EN: Flanges ridge the head, concentrating the force of a blow into a narrow edge that cracks armor plate rather than merely denting it. -->
  <UMW_Flanged.description>錘頭上隆起道道稜脊，將打擊的力量集中於狹窄的稜邊，足以擊裂裝甲板，而不只是將其砸凹。</UMW_Flanged.description>

  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>稜脊</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: riving -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>劈裂</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: armor-cracking -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>裂甲</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: gold inlay -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.label>鑲金</UMW_GoldInlay.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is inlaid with gold. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.description>該武器鑲有黃金。商人會為其支付更多錢。</UMW_GoldInlay.description>

  <!-- EN: gold -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.0>黃金</UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: golden -->
  <UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.1>金</UMW_GoldInlay.traitAdjectives.1>


  <!-- EN: head-weighted -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.label>頭重</UMW_HeadWeighted.label>

  <!-- EN: Mass is gathered toward the striking end so each swing lands with devastating force, though it is slower to recover. -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.description>重量集中於打擊端，每一次揮擊都勢大力沉，但揮擊後恢復較慢。</UMW_HeadWeighted.description>

  <!-- EN: devastating -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.0>毀滅</UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: mighty -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.1>威猛</UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ponderous -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.2>沉重</UMW_HeadWeighted.traitAdjectives.2>


