  <UMW_JadeInlay.label>鑲翡翠</UMW_JadeInlay.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is adorned with jade. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_JadeInlay.description>該武器鑲有翡翠。商人會為其支付更多錢。</UMW_JadeInlay.description>

  <!-- EN: jade -->
  <UMW_JadeInlay.traitAdjectives.0>翡翠</UMW_JadeInlay.traitAdjectives.0>


  <!-- EN: lightweight -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.label>輕巧</UMW_Lightweight.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is much lighter than normal, quickening its swing. -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.description>該武器比普通型號輕得多，揮擊速度更快。</UMW_Lightweight.description>

  <!-- EN: light -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.0>輕盈</UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: nimble -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.1>靈巧</UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: quickdraw -->
  <UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.2>速擊</UMW_Lightweight.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: needle point -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.label>針尖</UMW_NeedlePoint.label>

  <!-- EN: Tapered to a fine needle, the point drives deep beneath bone and muscle, seeking the organs within. Placing it cleanly demands slower, deliberate thrusts. -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.description>尖端收束成一根細針，可深入骨骼與肌肉之下，直探體內臟器。若要穩穩刺中，出刺便須更慢、更為審慎。</UMW_NeedlePoint.description>

  <!-- EN: needle -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>針鋒</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: needling -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.1>針刺</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: hypodermic -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.2>錐心</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: opiated -->
  <UMW_Opiated.label>鴉片塗層</UMW_Opiated.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is coated in a potent opiate that builds in the blood with each hit, eventually rendering the victim unconscious. -->
  <UMW_Opiated.description>尖端塗有強效鴉片類藥物，每次命中都會使其在血液中累積，最終令受害者失去知覺。</UMW_Opiated.description>

  <!-- EN: opiated -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.0>鴉片</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: sedative -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.1>鎮靜</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: soporific -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.2>催眠</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: numbing -->
  <UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.3>麻醉</UMW_Opiated.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: ornamental -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.label>裝飾性</UMW_Ornamental.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon was crafted for aesthetics over functionality. It deals less damage but looks great. -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.description>這把武器為美觀打造而犧牲了其功能性。它造成的傷害較低，但外觀出眾。</UMW_Ornamental.description>

  <!-- EN: beautiful -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.0>美觀</UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: elegant -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.1>華麗</UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ornamental -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.2>裝飾</UMW_Ornamental.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: piledriver -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.label>打樁頭</UMW_Piledriver.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is built as a piledriver. On command the weapon's full mass can be slammed into the ground, sending a stunning shockwave out through the earth. The shock is indiscriminate; it stuns friend and foe alike, though the braced wielder is spared. Once used, the mechanism takes time to reset. -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.description>錘頭採用打樁機構造。使用者可隨時驅動武器，將其全部質量猛然砸入地面，沿大地送出一道足以擊昏的衝擊波。這股衝擊不分敵我，友軍和敵人都會被擊昏，唯有撐穩武器的使用者安然無恙。使用之後，機構需要一段時間才能復位。</UMW_Piledriver.description>

  <!-- EN: piledriving -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.0>打樁</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: earthshaking -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.1>撼地</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: quaking -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.2>震顫</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: thunderous -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.3>雷鳴</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.3>

  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.abilityProps.chargeNoun>充能</UMW_Piledriver.abilityProps.chargeNoun>

  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.abilityProps.cooldownGerund>冷卻中</UMW_Piledriver.abilityProps.cooldownGerund>


  <!-- EN: quilloned -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.label>劍格</UMW_Quilloned.label>

  <!-- EN: Quillons flare wide from the hilt, letting the wielder catch incoming blows and turn them aside. -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.description>劍格自劍柄向兩側大幅張開，讓持有者得以架住來襲的攻擊並將其盪開。</UMW_Quilloned.description>

  <!-- EN: quilloned -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.0>寬格</UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: cross-guarded -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.1>十字格</UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: warding -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.2>守禦</UMW_Quilloned.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: razored -->
  <UMW_Razored.label>剃刀刃</UMW_Razored.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is honed to a keen razor that bites deeper and drives cleanly through armor. -->
  <UMW_Razored.description>刃口被研磨得如剃刀般鋒利，切入更深，還能乾淨利落地穿透護甲。</UMW_Razored.description>

  <!-- EN: razored -->
  <UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.0>剃刀</UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: razor-sharp -->
  <UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.1>鋒銳</UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: keen -->
  <UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.2>銳利</UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: serrated -->
  <UMW_Serrated.label>鋸齒刃</UMW_Serrated.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is cut into vicious teeth that tear ragged, freely bleeding wounds, though they slash a little shallower than a clean edge. On a thrust the same teeth catch and rip flesh as the blade is drawn back. -->
  <UMW_Serrated.description>刃口被開出兇惡的鋸齒，會撕出參差不齊、血流不止的傷口，只是砍切深度略遜於平整的刃口。突刺時，這些鋸齒同樣會在刀身抽回時鉤住並撕裂血肉。</UMW_Serrated.description>

  <!-- EN: serrated -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.0>鋸齒</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: jagged -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.1>獠牙</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: vicious -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.2>兇殘</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: sawtooth -->
  <UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.3>鋸牙</UMW_Serrated.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: storied -->
  <UMW_Storied.label>傳世</UMW_Storied.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon carries a recorded lineage of named bearers and remembered deeds. The wielder can raise it high in a rallying cry; allies who see it are steeled, and for a time wounds barely slow them. Such a moment can only be called upon once every few days. -->
  <UMW_Storied.description>該武器承載著一份記錄在冊的傳承，銘刻著歷代持有者的名號與流傳的功績。持有者可以將它高高舉起、發出鼓舞吶喊；目睹此物的盟友會因此士氣大振，一時之間傷痛幾乎無法拖慢他們的腳步。此等時刻每隔數日方能喚起一次。</UMW_Storied.description>

  <!-- EN: storied -->
  <UMW_Storied.traitAdjectives.0>傳世</UMW_Storied.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: fabled -->
