  <UMW_Studded.label>嵌釘錘頭</UMW_Studded.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is set with hard studs that concentrate the impact, driving extra force into every blow. -->
  <UMW_Studded.description>錘頭上嵌滿堅硬的凸釘，將衝擊集中起來，為每一擊注入額外的力道。</UMW_Studded.description>

  <!-- EN: studded -->
  <UMW_Studded.traitAdjectives.0>嵌釘</UMW_Studded.traitAdjectives.0>

